{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "60d71415-f11a-4dbe-b2a2-8a545d4320ee",
    "name": "OAN Grievance - Farmer (eSignet) + Officer endpoints",
    "description": "Farmer logs in with eSignet (OTP) through IAM bene portal and oan_auth_service, then calls every endpoint a beneficiary can call. Folder 6 holds OFFICER/ADMIN endpoints, which are NOT part of the beneficiary API. Layout follows consent-manager-beneficiary.postman_collection.json. Run with the environment: newman run <collection> -e postman/oan_grievance_environment.json --bail",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Farmer Login (eSignet via IAM bene portal + oan_auth_service)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1a. List login options",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/iam/providers",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "iam",
                "providers"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var d = (pm.response.json() || {}).data || {};",
                  "pm.test('beneficiary option is enabled', function () { pm.expect(JSON.stringify(d.providers)).to.include('\"' + pm.environment.get('iam_login_key') + '\"'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1b. Start login (oan_auth_service asks IAM for the eSignet URL)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/iam/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "iam",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"key\": \"{{iam_login_key}}\",\n  \"return_url\": \"{{iam_return_url}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var d = (pm.response.json() || {}).data || {};",
                  "pm.test('redirect_url returned', function () { pm.expect(d.redirect_url).to.be.a('string'); });",
                  "var q = {};",
                  "(d.redirect_url.split('?')[1] || '').split('&').forEach(function (p) { var i = p.indexOf('='); if (i > 0) { q[p.slice(0, i)] = decodeURIComponent(p.slice(i + 1).replace(/\\+/g, ' ')); } });",
                  "['client_id', 'redirect_uri', 'state', 'nonce', 'code_challenge', 'acr_values', 'scope'].forEach(function (k) { pm.environment.set('iam_' + k, q[k] || ''); });",
                  "pm.test('state present', function () { pm.expect(q.state).to.be.ok; });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1c. eSignet CSRF token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{esignet_url}}/csrf/token",
              "host": [
                "{{esignet_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "csrf",
                "token"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.environment.set('xsrf', pm.response.json().token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1d. eSignet OAuth details",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{xsrf}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{esignet_url}}/authorization/v2/oauth-details",
              "host": [
                "{{esignet_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "authorization",
                "v2",
                "oauth-details"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"requestTime\": \"{{now}}\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"clientId\": \"{{iam_client_id}}\",\n    \"scope\": \"{{iam_scope}}\",\n    \"responseType\": \"code\",\n    \"redirectUri\": \"{{iam_redirect_uri}}\",\n    \"display\": \"popup\",\n    \"prompt\": \"login\",\n    \"acrValues\": \"{{iam_acr_values}}\",\n    \"nonce\": \"{{iam_nonce}}\",\n    \"state\": \"{{iam_state}}\",\n    \"claimsLocales\": \"en\",\n    \"uiLocales\": \"en\",\n    \"claims\": {\"userinfo\": {\"name\": {\"essential\": false}}, \"id_token\": {}},\n    \"codeChallenge\": \"{{iam_code_challenge}}\",\n    \"codeChallengeMethod\": \"S256\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('now', new Date().toISOString());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.expect(b.response, JSON.stringify(b.errors)).to.be.ok;",
                  "pm.environment.set('txn', b.response.transactionId);",
                  "var hash = CryptoJS.SHA256(JSON.stringify(b.response)).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Base64).replace(/\\+/g, '-').replace(/\\//g, '_').replace(/=+$/, '');",
                  "pm.environment.set('oauth_hash', hash);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1e. eSignet send OTP (proxy OTP)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{xsrf}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "oauth-details-key",
                "value": "{{txn}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "oauth-details-hash",
                "value": "{{oauth_hash}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{esignet_url}}/authorization/send-otp",
              "host": [
                "{{esignet_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "authorization",
                "send-otp"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"requestTime\": \"{{now}}\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"transactionId\": \"{{txn}}\",\n    \"individualId\": \"{{esignet_individual_id}}\",\n    \"otpChannels\": [\"phone\"],\n    \"captchaToken\": \"x\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('now', new Date().toISOString());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var b = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (!b.response) { var e = (b.errors || [])[0] || {}; throw new Error('eSignet error: ' + (e.errorCode || '?') + ' - ' + (e.errorMessage || JSON.stringify(b))); }",
                  ""
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1f. eSignet authenticate with OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{xsrf}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "oauth-details-key",
                "value": "{{txn}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "oauth-details-hash",
                "value": "{{oauth_hash}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{esignet_url}}/authorization/v2/authenticate",
              "host": [
                "{{esignet_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "authorization",
                "v2",
                "authenticate"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"requestTime\": \"{{now}}\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"transactionId\": \"{{txn}}\",\n    \"individualId\": \"{{esignet_individual_id}}\",\n    \"challengeList\": [{\"authFactorType\": \"OTP\", \"challenge\": \"{{esignet_otp}}\", \"format\": \"alpha-numeric\"}]\n  }\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('now', new Date().toISOString());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var b = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (!b.response) { var e = (b.errors || [])[0] || {}; throw new Error('eSignet error: ' + (e.errorCode || '?') + ' - ' + (e.errorMessage || JSON.stringify(b))); }",
                  ""
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1g. eSignet authorize claims and get code",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{xsrf}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "oauth-details-key",
                "value": "{{txn}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "oauth-details-hash",
                "value": "{{oauth_hash}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{esignet_url}}/authorization/auth-code",
              "host": [
                "{{esignet_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "authorization",
                "auth-code"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"requestTime\": \"{{now}}\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"transactionId\": \"{{txn}}\",\n    \"acceptedClaims\": [\"name\"],\n    \"permittedAuthorizeScopes\": []\n  }\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('now', new Date().toISOString());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var b = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (!b.response) { var e = (b.errors || [])[0] || {}; throw new Error('eSignet error: ' + (e.errorCode || '?') + ' - ' + (e.errorMessage || JSON.stringify(b))); }",
                  "pm.test('auth code received', function () { pm.expect(b.response.code).to.be.ok; });",
                  "pm.environment.set('auth_code', b.response.code);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1h. IAM callback (exchange code, receive access token cookie)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{iam_url}}/auth/callback?state={{iam_state}}&code={{auth_code}}",
              "host": [
                "{{iam_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "callback"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "state",
                  "value": "{{iam_state}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "code",
                  "value": "{{auth_code}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('IAM redirects after exchange', function () { pm.expect([302, 303, 307]).to.include(pm.response.code); });",
                  "var prefix = pm.environment.get('iam_cookie_prefix') || '';",
                  "var cookies = pm.response.headers.filter(function (h) { return h.key.toLowerCase() === 'set-cookie'; }).map(function (h) { return h.value; });",
                  "var find = function (n) { var c = cookies.find(function (v) { return v.indexOf(prefix + n + '=') === 0; }); return c ? c.split(';')[0].slice((prefix + n).length + 1).replace(/^\"|\"$/g, '') : ''; };",
                  "var tok = find('X-Access-Token');",
                  "pm.test('access token cookie issued', function () { pm.expect(tok).to.not.be.empty; });",
                  "pm.environment.set('farmer_token', tok);",
                  "pm.environment.set('farmer_id_token', find('X-ID-Token'));",
                  "pm.environment.set('farmer_session_id', find('X-Session-Id'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "protocolProfileBehavior": {
            "followRedirects": false
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1i. Who am I (provisions the Frappe user on first login)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{farmer_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var d = (pm.response.json() || {}).data || {};",
                  "pm.test('login_option is the eSignet row', function () { pm.expect(d.login_option).to.eql(pm.environment.get('iam_login_key')); });",
                  "pm.test('has Grievance Submitter role', function () { pm.expect(d.roles).to.include('Grievance Submitter'); });",
                  "pm.environment.set('farmer_user', d.user);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "The farmer never types a password: eSignet sends an OTP (proxy OTP 111111 on the local mock identity system). oan_auth_service validates the eSignet access token through the IAM bene portal and provisions a local user with the row's default role (Grievance Submitter)."
    },
